WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.111 --> 00:00:15.152
Magua returned to the village.

2
00:00:15.792 --> 00:00:17.693
They had caught plenty of fish.

3
00:00:19.074 --> 00:00:22.636
Families were gathering for the Corn Festival dances.

4
00:00:23.977 --> 00:00:25.578
Everyone was celebrating!

5
00:00:25.598 --> 00:00:29.220
"Come, Vinnie, we must eat," said Magua.

6
00:00:30.148 --> 00:00:32.449
Baskets of food were passed around.

7
00:00:32.469 --> 00:00:34.651
"This is great!"

8
00:00:35.511 --> 00:00:37.552
Vinnie bit into some corn bread.

9
00:00:38.673 --> 00:00:41.874
He also had some corn soup and roasted corn.

10
00:00:42.595 --> 00:00:43.996
He was so hungry!

11
00:00:45.696 --> 00:00:47.678
Suddenly, Magua groaned.

12
00:00:48.298 --> 00:00:49.579
He held his stomach.

13
00:00:49.599 --> 00:00:51.219
"What's the matter?"

14
00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:52.600
asked Vinnie.

15
00:00:52.620 --> 00:00:56.522
"I feel sick," Magua said weakly.

16
00:00:57.463 --> 00:00:59.464
Clan Mother walked over to them.

17
00:01:00.508 --> 00:01:01.989
"What's the matter, Magua?"

18
00:01:02.449 --> 00:01:03.050
she asked.

19
00:01:04.271 --> 00:01:05.351
Vinnie explained.

20
00:01:05.371 --> 00:01:08.634
"Call the healers," she ordered.

21
00:01:08.654 --> 00:01:10.855
"Bring them to my house."

22
00:01:14.037 --> 00:01:18.240
Inside the longhouse, Magua lay on a bed by the wall.

23
00:01:19.421 --> 00:01:22.183
Soon, Vinnie heard strange noises.

24
00:01:23.524 --> 00:01:26.166
People were shaking rattles and chanting.

25
00:01:26.186 --> 00:01:27.927
"What's that?"

26
00:01:28.687 --> 00:01:29.308
he asked.

27
00:01:30.184 --> 00:01:33.146
"The healers are here," Clan Mother said.

28
00:01:34.327 --> 00:01:36.929
Vinnie heard scratching sounds at the door.

29
00:01:38.550 --> 00:01:40.191
Clan Mother let them in.

30
00:01:41.311 --> 00:01:44.754
People wearing ugly masks danced into the room.

31
00:01:45.814 --> 00:01:47.275
Vinnie almost screamed.

32
00:01:48.336 --> 00:01:50.418
The carved masks were scary.

33
00:01:51.318 --> 00:01:54.500
A large tongue hung out of the mouth of one mask.

34
00:01:55.641 --> 00:01:59.864
The healers called out in screeching voices and jumped around.

35
00:02:01.072 --> 00:02:02.253
Vinnie was afraid.

36
00:02:02.954 --> 00:02:05.376
But Magua did not look frightened.

37
00:02:06.317 --> 00:02:07.718
He only looked sick.

38
00:02:08.719 --> 00:02:10.660
The masked group came closer.

39
00:02:11.841 --> 00:02:13.863
They threw ashes on Magua.

40
00:02:15.124 --> 00:02:18.007
They leaned over him and chanted louder.

41
00:02:18.027 --> 00:02:20.348
"Stay away!

42
00:02:20.709 --> 00:02:21.610
He's my friend!"

43
00:02:22.390 --> 00:02:23.271
Vinnie shouted.

44
00:02:24.592 --> 00:02:28.856
At that moment, Mandy and Onatah came into the house.

45
00:02:30.172 --> 00:02:32.453
Onatah held their corn husk doll.

46
00:02:32.473 --> 00:02:34.933
"What's going on?"

47
00:02:35.734 --> 00:02:36.474
asked Mandy.

48
00:02:37.514 --> 00:02:41.015
She saw the masked dancers around Vinnie and screamed.

49
00:02:41.035 --> 00:02:44.436
"Don't touch him!"

50
00:02:45.036 --> 00:02:45.676
she cried.

51
00:02:46.477 --> 00:02:49.077
Mandy ran and stood in front of her brother.

52
00:02:50.218 --> 00:02:51.478
The dancers stopped.

53
00:02:52.178 --> 00:02:53.659
They murmured to each other.

54
00:02:53.679 --> 00:02:55.979
"Vinnie! Mandy!"

55
00:02:56.599 --> 00:02:58.280
Clan Mother was angry.

56
00:02:59.296 --> 00:03:01.398
"You should never stop the healers!

57
00:03:01.838 --> 00:03:03.059
It is our tradition.

58
00:03:03.820 --> 00:03:05.541
It is how the sick get well."

59
00:03:07.042 --> 00:03:09.144
Vinnie and Mandy were embarrassed.

60
00:03:09.164 --> 00:03:13.127
"We're sorry," they apologized.

61
00:03:13.147 --> 00:03:16.991
"Clan Mother," Magua called weakly.

62
00:03:17.491 --> 00:03:18.792
He tried to sit up.

63
00:03:20.033 --> 00:03:20.854
"I'm feeling better.

64
00:03:21.474 --> 00:03:23.176
Maybe I ate too much corn bread."

65
00:03:23.756 --> 00:03:25.037
He smiled weakly.

66
00:03:25.057 --> 00:03:28.140
"Clan Mother, what are we to do?"

67
00:03:29.016 --> 00:03:30.417
asked one of the healers.

68
00:03:31.478 --> 00:03:33.479
Clan Mother looked at Magua.

69
00:03:33.499 --> 00:03:36.982
"He seems better," she replied.

70
00:03:37.002 --> 00:03:38.823
"You have cured him.

71
00:03:39.643 --> 00:03:41.104
Your magic is good."

72
00:03:42.625 --> 00:03:44.346
The dancers left the house.

73
00:03:44.367 --> 00:03:48.569
"We were very scared," Mandy said.

74
00:03:49.850 --> 00:03:55.974
Clan Mother nodded and said: "You do not understand the magic of the Iroquois.

75
00:03:56.735 --> 00:03:58.216
That is why you fear."

76
00:03:59.332 --> 00:04:02.593
"I don't know much about your people," said Vinnie.

77
00:04:02.613 --> 00:04:05.234
"But Mandy and I would love to learn."

78
00:04:06.435 --> 00:04:09.616
Clan Mother placed a hand over her heart.

79
00:04:10.536 --> 00:04:14.197
"I will tell you how the Iroquois became the Five Nations.

80
00:04:15.338 --> 00:04:19.659
It was through one man's journey for peace—Deganawidah.

81
00:04:20.739 --> 00:04:22.000
Here is his story."
